<title>USA: Fidelity National to sell American Title.</title>
<headline>Fidelity National to sell American Title.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fidelity National Financial Inc, a title insurance underwriter, said it had entered into negotiations to sell a majority interest in American Title Co, an underwritten title company, to some members of its management.</p>
<p>The underwriter said details of the transaction regarding American Title, which does business in 13 counties in California, were being discussed.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
